<title>USA: Total Access sets $400 mln in 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Total Access sets $400 mln in 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Total Access Communication Plc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager UBS Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER TOTAL ACCESS COMMUNICATIONS PLC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	  COUPON 8.375	MATURITY 11/4/06</p>
<p>TYPE 144A NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.773  FIRST PAY DATE 4/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BA1	YIELD 8.409 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS  SPREAD 200 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	  COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 11/4/01</p>
<p>TYPE 144A NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.971  FIRST PAY DATE 4/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BA1	YIELD 7.632 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS  SPREAD 150 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
